OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly cloudy with some patchy
OL,6,Flight rain and drizzle this morning.
OL,7,FOutbreaks of rain will become more
OL,8,Fextensive through the afternoon,
OL,9,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,10,Fheavier later on.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain spreading in from the
OL,13,Fwest becomes widespread and
OL,14,Foccasionally heavy this evening. Rain
OL,15,Fmoves northeast, lingering over
OL,16,FCaithness through the night. Drier
OL,17,Felsewhere with a few scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
