OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA risk of some early rain
OL,6,Facross Caithness. Elsewhere a bright
OL,7,Fbut rather cloudy day with showers or
OL,8,Fperhaps some longer spells of rain.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,11,FNortherly winds developing bringing a
OL,12,Frather chilly feel with scattered
OL,13,Fshowers, some possibly heavy on
OL,14,FWednesday and merging into longer
OL,15,Fspells of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
